{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"RP17 rationale corrected by maintainer. This is not an acceptance of ambient AWS encryption defaults as configured today. Final governing decision: Rebar is a public OSS project, no strong rationale has been demonstrated for requiring encryption on its Gerrit instance, and the recommendation that encryption be repository-enforced is permanently rejected regardless of current configuration. Renamed the registry entry to KF-S18-gerrit-ebs-encryption-enforcement and updated the Janitor report; its deterministic staleness guards remain."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788285428396884001,"uuid":"7d528d8c-f0a6-4a3c-8a50-697242802f17"}